url: "https://github.com/aydinmonavvari/ml-market-prediction-study"
abstract: >-
  A leakage-free, walk-forward research study asking whether machine learning
  provides statistically significant incremental out-of-sample predictive
  information for next-day equity index direction beyond simple baselines.
  Includes an exact McNemar significance framework, a label-permutation sanity
  control, and a cost-adjusted long/flat evaluation. Research software only --
  not investment advice.
keywords:
  - machine learning
  - empirical finance
  - walk-forward validation
  - data leakage
  - efficient market hypothesis
